      "message": "Is there some reason this can\u0027t be handled by ALLOW_MISSING_DEPENDENCIES\u003dtrue on the command line?\n\nWhen do you expect this function to be called?  If it is from the factory method, you can use a bool in PackagingBase instead of a `blueprint:\"mutated\"` property, because each time a new variant is created the factory method is called again to create a new empty module.",
      "revId": "1b6b47f61c4abbdb8df8bcce1d3a1201a84307e8",
