      "writtenOn": "2020-11-18T07:28:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ALLOW_MISSING_DEPENDENCIES is global. This actually is needed for cvd-host-package where there might be a reference to a module in a Google-only or Auto-only projects.\n\n\u003e When do you expect this function to be called?\n\nIn cvd-host-package. See aosp/1492456\n\n\nChanged to a bool field.",
      "parentUuid": "3f8d1eb9_760467a8",
      "revId": "1b6b47f61c4abbdb8df8bcce1d3a1201a84307e8",
